{"id":3117,"slug":"3117-mro-method-resolution-order-la-gi-python-giai-quyet-diamond-problem-the-nao","category":"Python","subcategory":"OOP","level":"advanced","question_vi":"MRO (Method Resolution Order) là gì? Python giải quyết diamond problem thế nào?","question_en":"What is MRO? How does Python solve the diamond problem?","answer_vi":"MRO xác định thứ tự Python tìm method trong cây kế thừa, dùng thuật toán C3 Linearization. Giải quyết diamond problem bằng cách đảm bảo mỗi class chỉ xuất hiện một lần.\n```python\nclass A:\n    def method(self): print(\"A\")\n\nclass B(A):\n    def method(self): super().method(); print(\"B\")\n\nclass C(A):\n    def method(self): super().method(); print(\"C\")\n\nclass D(B, C): pass\n\nD().method()   # A → C → B (theo MRO)\nprint(D.__mro__)  # D, B, C, A, object\n```\nXem MRO: `ClassName.__mro__` hoặc `ClassName.mro()`.","answer_en":"MRO defines the order Python searches for methods in the inheritance tree, using C3 Linearization. Solves the diamond problem by ensuring each class appears only once.\n```python\nclass D(B, C): pass\nprint(D.__mro__)  # D → B → C → A → object\nD().method()      # Calls in MRO order\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">MRO xác định thứ tự Python tìm method trong cây kế thừa, dùng thuật toán C3 Linearization.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Giải quyết diamond problem bằng cách đảm bảo mỗi class chỉ xuất hiện một lần.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class A:\n    def method(self): print(&quot;A&quot;)\n\nclass B(A):\n    def method(self): super().method(); print(&quot;B&quot;)\n\nclass C(A):\n    def method(self): super().method(); print(&quot;C&quot;)\n\nclass D(B, C): pass\n\nD().method()   # A → C → B (theo MRO)\nprint(D.__mro__)  # D, B, C, A, object\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">method</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>): <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;A&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">A</span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">method</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>): <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">super</span>().method(); <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;B&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">C</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">A</span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">method</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>): <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">super</span>().method(); <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;C&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">D</span>(B, C): <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">pass</span>\n\nD().method()   <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># A → C → B (theo MRO)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">print</span>(D.__mro__)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># D, B, C, A, object</span></code></pre></div><p>Xem MRO: <code>ClassName.__mro__</code> hoặc <code>ClassName.mro()</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">MRO defines the order Python searches for methods in the inheritance tree, using C3 Linearization.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Solves the diamond problem by ensuring each class appears only once.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class D(B, C): pass\nprint(D.__mro__)  # D → B → C → A → object\nD().method()      # Calls in MRO order\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">D</span>(B, C): <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">pass</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">print</span>(D.__mro__)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># D → B → C → A → object</span>\nD().method()      <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Calls in MRO order</span></code></pre></div>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3115-4-nguyen-ly-oop-trong-python","title":"4 nguyên lý OOP trong Python?"},{"url":"/q/3116-classmethod-vs-staticmethod-vs-instance-method","title":"`@classmethod` vs `@staticmethod` vs instance method?"},{"url":"/q/3118-property-decorator-dung-the-nao","title":"`@property` decorator dùng thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3119-abstract-class-trong-python-dung-the-nao","title":"Abstract class trong Python — dùng thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3120-dataclass-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-class-thuong","title":"`@dataclass` là gì? Lợi ích so với class thường?"},{"url":"/q/3121-slots-la-gi-khi-nao-nen-dung","title":"`__slots__` là gì? Khi nào nên dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3122-cac-dunder-methods-quan-trong-nhat-can-biet","title":"Các dunder methods quan trọng nhất cần biết?"},{"url":"/q/3101-python-quan-ly-bo-nho-nhu-the-nao","title":"Python quản lý bộ nhớ như thế nào?"}]}